      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III Eg</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be mynetum ⁊ gemettum.] [Ld] ⁊ gange án mynet ofer ealne þæs cyninges anweald, ⁊ þone nan man ne forsace.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And one coinage shall be current throughout all the king's realm, and no-one shall refuse it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ga an mynet ofer ealne þæs cynges anweald, ⁊ þane nan man ne forsace;</ab>
      </div>
